Write a concise plain-text weekly movie-radar email using only the bounded evidence below. Start directly with the content and use short paragraphs or simple labeled lines; do not use Markdown image syntax or HTML.

Preference: ${movie_criteria}
Selected movie: ${top_title} (${top_year})
Release date: ${top_release_date}
Genres: ${top_genres}
Overview: ${top_overview}
Rating and votes: ${top_rating} from ${top_votes} votes
TMDB details: ${top_movie_details}
Cast: ${top_cast}
Crew: ${top_crew}
Current reporting: ${current_grounding}
Current sources: ${current_sources}
TMDB link: ${top_tmdb_url}
Attribution: ${tmdb_attribution}

Explain why this pick matches the requested genre and exclusions, summarize the strongest supported premise/cast/release facts, and distinguish confirmed information from uncertain current reporting. Do not invent a streaming provider. Note that the full rolling report is in Jarvis Canvas. End with the exact TMDB link and the exact attribution. The email integration receives the public poster separately through image_url and the TMDB destination through link_url.
